        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>去张家界6次整理8千字干货 - 交通篇（含租车细节）</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #eef1f8;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  /* Title bar */\n  .title-bar {\n    background: #4a6fa8;\n    padding: 8px 6px 10px 6px;\n  }\n  .title-bar .headline {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 2px solid #2f4f7f;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 4px 0 6px 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .title-bar .headline .red { color: #e8342a; }\n  .subtitle {\n    background: #dfe6f3;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 10px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .subtitle .box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #2f4f7f;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1b3f73;\n    padding: 4px 26px 6px 26px;\n  }\n  /* Sections */\n  .section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    border-top: 2px solid #2f4f7f;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #2f4f7f;\n    background: #eef1f8;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .label {\n    flex: 0 0 54px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    color: #111;\n    padding: 6px 2px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #b9c4da;\n  }\n  .content {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    padding: 8px 10px 10px 10px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n  }\n  .content p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .red { color: #e8342a; }\n  .num { color: #e8342a; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    <div class=\"headline\">去张家界<span class=\"red\">6次整理8千字</span>干货</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">\n    <div class=\"box\">交通篇（含租车细节）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"label\">机场<br>→<br>市区</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p><span class=\"num\">1、</span><span class=\"red\">机场大巴</span>：实际上是中巴车，写有“张家界机场大酒店”或张家界荷花机场”字样，一般停在机场出口，十几分钟路程，5元到市区的机场大酒店。</p>\n      <p><span class=\"num\">2、</span><span class=\"red\">公交车</span>：乘坐4路公交车(8:00-18:00) 进入市区，票价1元(无人售票)，约0.5小时可到。机场大门口前100m处为4路公交车始发站，为环城线，为AB线，故建议上车前先向乘务员咨询所去目的地应乘坐路线，及转车地点。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"label\">市<br>内</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p><span class=\"num\">1、</span><span class=\"red\">张家界市区内班车</span>：在火车站旁边的汽车站乘坐到武陵源景区或者张家界国家森林公园的线路车，15分钟左右一般，到张家界国家森林公园门票站大约20元/人，车程50分钟左右。</p>\n      <p><span class=\"num\">2、</span>张家界市区<span class=\"red\">打车</span>到武陵源景区大概100元左右。</p>\n      <p><span class=\"num\">3、</span><span class=\"red\">自驾车</span>过去的话，只能停车在门票站外，停车费大概在50元/天。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"label\">租<br>车<br>细<br>则</div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p>1.租车要提前预定，旺季需<span class=\"red\">提前3天预定</span>好</p>\n      <p>2.选靠谱的<span class=\"red\">正规大型平台</span>租车，不要考虑小平台</p>\n      <p>3.不管是哪个平台都要<span class=\"red\">买好车险</span></p>\n      <p>4.租车的时候要<span class=\"red\">检查车况</span>，车胎/备胎/刹车/换胎工具/应急工具等等，最好好是拍照/录视频记录一下，车子里程也要拍照留底，一旦发现车子有损坏的地方，立马跟平台说明情况，请求换车处理</p>\n      <p>5.租车平台参考：<span class=\"red\">tb/飞猪/携程/一嗨/神州</span>（自己对比选择）</p>\n      <p>6.价格：一般一天200~300，<span class=\"red\">押金5000</span>，15天后无纠纷原路退回</p>\n      <p>7.<span class=\"red\">第一次去不建议租车</span>，不熟悉路况，容易吃罚单也怕事故</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
